# Accounts (optional in dev): the same Supabase project as backend/.env.
# Build-time values — set them before `vite build`. Without both, the sign-in
# screen is skipped and the backend's auth bypass serves a fixed dev user.
# The anon key is public by design (RLS guards the tables).
#VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
#VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
